<div id="abaFunil" class="aba-conteudo hidden">
    <div class="mb-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-end gap-3">
        <div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800">🔽 Funil de Produção Gráfica</h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1">O volume planejado respeita os caminhos (Acabadoras vs Gráficas), ignorando saltos.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 p-3 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase mb-2 block border-b border-slate-100 pb-1">Filtro de Fases (Funil):</span>
            <div id="containerCheckboxesFunil" class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs font-semibold"></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 mb-8 flex flex-col items-center" id="containerFunilVisual"></div>

    <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 overflow-x-auto scroller mb-5">
        <h3 class="text-xs font-black text-slate-700 uppercase mb-3 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2">Marca / Tiragem Absoluta Concluída</h3>
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse text-xs whitespace-nowrap">
            <thead><tr class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-500 uppercase border-b border-slate-300" id="thFunilMarcaTiragem"></tr></thead>
            <tbody id="tbFunilMarcaTiragem" class="text-slate-700"></tbody>
        </table>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 overflow-x-auto scroller mb-8">
        <h3 class="text-xs font-black text-slate-700 uppercase mb-3 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2">Marca / % Realizado</h3>
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse text-xs whitespace-nowrap">
            <thead><tr class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-500 uppercase border-b border-slate-300" id="thFunilMarcaPct"></tr></thead>
            <tbody id="tbFunilMarcaPct" class="text-slate-800 font-bold"></tbody>
        </table>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 overflow-x-auto scroller mb-5">
        <h3 class="text-xs font-black text-slate-700 uppercase mb-3 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2">Gráfica / Tiragem Absoluta Concluída</h3>
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse text-xs whitespace-nowrap">
            <thead><tr class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-500 uppercase border-b border-slate-300" id="thFunilGraficaTiragem"></tr></thead>
            <tbody id="tbFunilGraficaTiragem" class="text-slate-700"></tbody>
        </table>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 overflow-x-auto scroller mb-8">
        <h3 class="text-xs font-black text-slate-700 uppercase mb-3 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2">Gráfica / % Realizado</h3>
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse text-xs whitespace-nowrap">
            <thead><tr class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-500 uppercase border-b border-slate-300" id="thFunilGraficaPct"></tr></thead>
            <tbody id="tbFunilGraficaPct" class="text-slate-800 font-bold"></tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 mb-8">
        <h3 class="text-xs font-black text-slate-700 uppercase mb-2">Curva de Coleta Prevista — Esperado x Realizado</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-4">Base, planejamento e volume coletado seguem exatamente os filtros Origem e Destino aplicados no portal.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-5 text-xs text-slate-600">
            <label class="border border-slate-200 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 cursor-pointer"><input type="radio" name="visaoColetaFunil" value="mensal" checked onchange="renderColetaFinalFunil()"> Mensal (fechado por mês)</label>
            <label class="border border-slate-200 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 cursor-pointer"><input type="radio" name="visaoColetaFunil" value="atual" onchange="renderColetaFinalFunil()"> Mês Atual</label>
            <label class="border border-slate-200 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 cursor-pointer"><input type="radio" name="visaoColetaFunil" value="personalizado" onchange="renderColetaFinalFunil()"> Data personalizada</label>
            <div id="periodoColetaFunil" class="hidden flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
                <label>De <input id="inicioColetaFunil" type="date" class="border rounded px-2 py-1" onchange="renderColetaFinalFunil()"></label>
                <label>Até <input id="fimColetaFunil" type="date" class="border rounded px-2 py-1" onchange="renderColetaFinalFunil()"></label>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-3">
            <button type="button" onclick="exportarAuditoriaMetaColeta()" class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-600 border border-slate-200 rounded px-3 py-1.5 hover:bg-slate-50">Baixar auditoria do forecast</button>
            <button id="btnForecastColetaFunil" type="button" onclick="window.pgAbrirEditorForecastColeta()" class="hidden text-xs font-bold text-violet-700 border border-violet-200 bg-violet-50 rounded px-3 py-1.5 hover:bg-violet-100">Registrar Meta</button>
        </div>
        <div id="editorForecastColetaFunil" class="hidden mb-4"></div>
        <div id="resumoColetaFinalFunil" class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-xs text-slate-700 mb-4"></div>
        <div class="overflow-x-auto scroller">
            <div id="larguraColetaFunil">
                <div class="relative h-80"><canvas id="grafColetaFinalFunil"></canvas></div>
                <div id="diasColetaFunil" style="display:grid;padding:0 24px"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <a id="linkExtracaoColetaFunil" hidden target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-700 underline">Abrir planilha extraída</a>
        <p id="notaColetaFinalFunil" class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-3"></p>
    </div>
</div>
